<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Zomsi" description="Privacy Policy for the Zomsi website and Zomsi Info Tech Private Limited.">
<main class="section"><div class="container legal-copy">
<span class="eyebrow">Zomsi privacy</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4.8rem);margin-top:18px">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lead">Last updated: August 18, 2026</p>
<h2>Overview</h2><p>This policy covers the Zomsi website (zomsi.co) and Zomsi Info Tech Private Limited as a company. It does not describe the data practices of any individual Zomsi app — each app publishes its own privacy policy covering what that app specifically collects and how it is used, linked from the app's page.</p>
<h2>Information collected on this website</h2><p>This is a static informational website. We do not run visitor accounts or collect information beyond what your browser sends automatically (such as standard web server request logs) and any information you choose to send us directly, for example by emailing us.</p>
<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This site does not set marketing or tracking cookies. If we add analytics in the future to understand site usage, this section will be updated to describe what is collected and how to opt out.</p>
<h2>Contact form and email</h2><p>If you email us, we use the information you provide (such as your email address and message) only to respond to your inquiry. We do not sell or share this information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
<h2>App-specific privacy policies</h2><p>Each Zomsi app has its own privacy policy describing the data that app collects, how it is used, and how it is stored. For example, see the <a href="/rummyscore/privacy">Rummy Score Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Children's privacy</h2><p>This website is not directed at children and is not designed to collect personal information from children.</p>
<h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>This policy may be updated from time to time. The latest version will always be published on this page.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@zomsi.co"><strong>contact@zomsi.co</strong></a>, or by mail to Zomsi Info Tech Private Limited, Plot No 284, Road No 4, Phase-II, NJR KLR Nagar, Medchal, Telangana, 501401.</p>
</div></main>
</Layout>
